@startuml game_main

package game {
  class Main {
    + main(args: String[]): void {static}
  }
}

package db {
  class DbManager {
    + initSchema(): void
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getInstance(): GameWindow {static}
    + frame(): void
  }
}

package javax.swing {
  class SwingUtilities
  class JFrame
}

Main ..> DbManager : calls initSchema()
Main ..> SwingUtilities : calls invokeLater(Runnable)
Main ..> GameWindow : uses getInstance()
GameWindow ..> JFrame : manages / shows

note right of Main
  - **役割**: アプリ起動処理を行うエントリポイント
  - **Responsibilities**: initialize DB schema and start UI on EDT
end note

@enduml